 on floors","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/5/davco-superfine-whitegrout.pdf","v":"December 2025, Version 01.01","p":2}},{"id":"davco-superfine-whitegrout:suitability:04f91414","type":"suitability","pol":"no","cond":false,"tags":{"environment":["submerged"]},"text":"Do not use on submerged applications including pools, ponds, spas or water features","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/5/davco-superfine-whitegrout.pdf","v":"December 2025, Version 01.01","p":2}},{"id":"davco-superfine-whitegrout:restriction:b95e93d4","type":"restriction","pol":"no","cond":false,"tags":{},"text":"Do not use in movement joints.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/5/davco-superfine-whitegrout.pdf","v":"December 2025, Version 01.01","p":2}},{"id":"davco-superfine-whitegrout:restriction:1b417a43","type":"restriction","pol":"no","cond":true,"tags":{},"text":"Product may not be suitable for stone sensitive to moisture, test prior to installation for compatibility.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/5/davco-superfine-whitegrout.pdf","v":"December 2025, Version 01.01","p":2}}],"safety":{"status":"published","sds":[{"title":"SDS Davco Superfine White Grout","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","revision_date":"20.01.2025","version":"2.0","sds_number":"100000037034","pages":11,"product_name_on_sds":"Davco Superfine White Grout","latest_for_name":true,"name_matches_product":true,"classification":[{"hazard_class":"Skin corrosion/irritation","category":"Category 2","text":"Skin corrosion/irritation : Category 2","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}},{"hazard_class":"Serious eye damage/eye irritation","category":"Category 1","text":"Serious eye damage/eye irritation : Category 1","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}},{"hazard_class":"Skin sensitisation","category":"Category 1","text":"Skin sensitisation : Category 1","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}},{"hazard_class":"Specific target organ toxicity - single exposure","category":"Category 3 (Respiratory system)","text":"Specific target organ toxicity - single exposure : Category 3 (Respiratory system)","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}}],"hazard_statements":[{"code":"H315","statement":"Causes skin irritation.","text":"H315 Causes skin irritation.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}},{"code":"H317","statement":"May cause an allergic skin reaction.","text":"H317 May cause an allergic skin reaction.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}},{"code":"H318","statement":"Causes serious eye damage.","text":"H318 Causes serious eye damage.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}},{"code":"H335","statement":"May cause respiratory irritation.","text":"H335 May cause respiratory irritation.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}}],"precautionary_statements":[{"group":"Prevention","code":"P261","statement":"Avoid breathing dust.","text":"P261 Avoid breathing dust.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}},{"group":"Prevention","code":"P264","statement":"Wash skin thoroughly after handling.","text":"P264 Wash skin thoroughly after handling.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}},{"group":"Prevention","code":"P271","statement":"Use only outdoors or in a well-ventilated area.","text":"P271 Use only outdoors or in a well-ventilated area.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}},{"group":"Prevention","code":"P272","statement":"Contaminated work clothing should not be allowed out of the workplace.","text":"P272 Contaminated work clothing should not be allowed out of the workplace.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1,"pe":2}},{"group":"Prevention","code":"P280","statement":"Wear protective gloves/ eye protection/ face protection.","text":"P280 Wear protective gloves/ eye protection/ face protection.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":2}},{"group":"Response","code":"P302 + P352","statement":"IF ON SKIN: Wash with plenty of water.","text":"P302 + P352 IF ON SKIN: Wash with plenty of water.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":2}},{"group":"Response","code":"P304 + P340 + P312","statement":"IF INHALED: Remove person to fresh air and keep comfortable for breathing. Call a POISON CENTER/ doctor if you feel unwell.","text":"P304 + P340 + P312 IF INHALED: Remove person to fresh air and keep comfortable for breathing. Call a POISON CENTER/ doctor if you feel unwell.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":2}},{"group":"Response","code":"P305 + P351 + P338 + P310","statement":"IF IN EYES: Rinse cautiously with water for several minutes. Remove contact lenses, if present and easy to do. Continue rinsing. Immediately call a POISON CENTER/ doctor.","text":"P305 + P351 + P338 + P310 IF IN EYES: Rinse cautiously with water for several minutes. Remove contact lenses, if present and easy to do. Continue rinsing. Immediately call a POISON CENTER/ doctor.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":2}},{"group":"Response","code":"P333 + P313","statement":"If skin irritation or rash occurs: Get medical advice/ attention.","text":"P333 + P313 If skin irritation or rash occurs: Get medical advice/ attention.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":2}},{"group":"Response","code":"P362 + P364","statement":"Take off contaminated clothing and wash it before reuse.","text":"P362 + P364 Take off contaminated clothing and wash it before reuse.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":2}},{"group":"Storage","code":"P403 + P233","statement":"Store in a well-ventilated place. Keep container tightly closed.","text":"P403 + P233 Store in a well-ventilated place. Keep container tightly closed.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":2}},{"group":"Disposal","code":"P501","statement":"Dispose of contents/ container to an approved waste disposal plant.","text":"P501 Dispose of contents/ container to an approved waste disposal plant.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":2}}],"storage":[{"label":"Conditions for safe storage","text":"Store in original container. Keep in a well-ventilated place. Observe label precautions. Store in accordance with local regulations.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":4}},{"label":"Further information on storage stability","text":"Keep in a dry place. No decomposition if stored and applied as directed.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":4}}],"handling":[{"label":"Advice on protection against fire and explosion","text":"Avoid dust formation. Provide appropriate exhaust ventilation at places where dust is formed.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":4}},{"label":"Advice on safe handling","text":"Avoid exceeding the given occupational exposure limits (see section 8). Do not get in eyes, on skin, or on clothing. For personal protection see section 8. Persons with a history of skin sensitisation problems or asthma, allergies, chronic or recurrent respiratory disease should not be employed in any process in which this mixture is being used. Smoking, eating and drinking should be prohibited in the application area. Follow standard hygiene measures when handling chemical products Sika 03 Do not breathe vapours/dust.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":4}},{"label":"Hygiene measures","text":"Handle in accordance with good industrial hygiene and safety practice. When using do not eat or drink. When using do not smoke. Wash hands before breaks and at the end of workday.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":4}}],"signal_word":{"value":"Danger","text":"Signal word : Danger","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":1}},"ppe":{"respiratory":{"label":"Respiratory protection","text":"In case of inadequate ventilation wear respiratory protection. Respirator selection must be based on known or anticipated exposure levels, the hazards of the product and the safe working limits of the selected respirator. particulate filter P","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":5}},"hands":{"label":"Hand protection","text":"Chemical-resistant, impervious gloves complying with an approved standard should be worn at all times when handling chemical products if a risk assessment indicates this is necessary. Follow AS/NZS 1337.1 Recommended: Butyl rubber, PVC, cotton gloves","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":5}},"eyes":{"label":"Eye protection","text":"Safety glasses","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":5}},"skin_body":{"label":"Skin and body protection","text":"Protective clothing (e.g. safety shoes, long-sleeved working clothing, long trousers) Follow AS 2210:3","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":5}},"engineering_controls":{"label":"Appropriate engineering controls","text":"Avoid dust formation. Provide appropriate exhaust ventilation at places where dust is formed.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":4}}},"transport_adg":{"un_number":"Not applicable","class":"Not applicable","text":"UN number : Not applicable","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/0/sds-davco-superfinewhitegrout.pdf","v":"Revision 20.01.2025, Version 2.0","p":9}}}]},"spec":{"ds":{"url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/5/davco-superfine-whitegrout.pdf","title":"Davco® Superfine White Grout","edition":"December 2025, Version 01.01","version":"01.01","issued":"December 2025"},"std":[{"citation":"AS ISO 13007.3","section":"PRODUCT INFORMATION","page":1,"context":"AS ISO 13007.3 CG1"},{"citation":"SCAQMD method 304-91","section":"PRODUCT INFORMATION","page":1,"context":"Low VOC - 3g/L (SCAQMD method 304-91)"}]}}